NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY ASSETS AND MODELS

The MIT license above covers the notes, roadmap, scripts and code written in
this repository.

Robot descriptions, meshes, worlds, datasets and pretrained models obtained
from elsewhere (for example UR, SO-101, Gazebo Fuel, Isaac assets, Hugging
Face models) keep their own licenses. Record the source and license of each
one next to where it is used, and do not commit anything whose license does
not allow redistribution — link to it instead.

Code derived from ROS 2 packages is usually Apache-2.0 or BSD-3-Clause; keep
the original license headers when you copy or adapt such code.
